  "notes": "GAAP. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5-6); original issue premium 77,483 in other_financing, bond proceeds 5,055,000 in debt_proceeds. Business-type from Total Enterprise Funds (p9-10); the governmental-activities internal service fund is excluded. Business-type receipts total = operating revenues + gain on disposal + investment earnings; disbursements total 12,629,503 = operating expenses 11,726,008 + interest expense 903,495 (SoA p2). Business-type beginning net position restated by error correction (203,408) (p10). ending_cash = governmental funds cash and cash equivalents + cash at county treasurer (p4); investments 15,838,434 separately. Detail from the budget-basis budget-and-actual schedules for General, Streets/Engineering, Sales Tax, 1/2 Sales Tax and ARP Act funds (p13-17); no supplementary schedules for other governmental or enterprise funds. Read pages 1-17 of 17"
